 "notes": "SIGNATURE. Cut, then point, then point: the only dagger whose follow-ups are all thrusts, so once the chain is started it finishes inside a guard the shell-knife has to go around.\n\nLineage: thorn — Root-thorn: a hooked point that is drawn back through the wound, so every cut ends lower and further inside than the shell knives'.\nMandatory slots present: 25/25. Total slots: 33.\nart.1/art.2 trigger: the schema's trigger block cannot express a chord, so the declared button is 'two_hand' with modifier hold/double_tap. The runtime conjunction is 'heavy pressed while two_hand is HELD' (art.1) and 'heavy HELD while two_hand is HELD' (art.2) — game/data/weapons/input-map.json is authoritative and machine-readable."
}
